==Battleground==
*1 [[Duche]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[Gobble]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Zuche]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Satan Claus]] spawns as the boss.
**6 [[Duche]]s spawn, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**3 [[Gobble]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
**3 [[Zuche]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
**1 [[Dark Emperor Santa]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellite]] is a very good Meatshield here, but is not perfect, so bring another. [[Cutter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cutter Cat]] is a great choice for dealing with the Dark Emperor, as well as Gobble, though another unit such as [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Butterfly Cat]] may work better against the latter; regardless of what you bring, always include at least something quick to deal with Gobble. A high range unit such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] will do you wonders, as long as they are defended. 

